WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.410
A silhouetted ballerina stands in fifth position, feet neatly crossed.

2
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.600
She springs straight up in a soubresaut, feet together, one arm sweeping high.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.890
Gliding, she leaps again, arms opening wide like wings.

4
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:18.680
From a deep plié bend, she launches into a soaring sissonne split leap.

5
00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:22.540
Flowing through a graceful port de bras, she arches toward the light.
